+Point --policy_host/--policy_port at a running
+`python -m cosmos_framework.scripts.action_policy_server_robolab --domain-name so101
+--action-dim 6 --arm-joint-dim 5 --checkpoint-path <so101 fine-tune export>` (cosmos-framework
